cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "IRIDIUM: Real-Time Urban Mobility Prediction and Optimization Platform"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-03-08"
url: "https://github.com/iridium-oss/iridium"
repository-code: "https://github.com/iridium-oss/iridium"
license: "EUPL-1.2"
abstract: >
  IRIDIUM is a real-time urban mobility prediction and optimization platform
  for Azerbaijani cities, designed around federated learning, a dynamic urban
  mobility digital twin, multimodal routing, anomaly detection, and equity-aware
  mobility analytics. The platform uses real data sources when configured
  (OSM, Open-Meteo, optional traffic and transit) and exposes explicit
  data status when sources are unavailable.
